    "text": "Gehyra\u00f0 nu, men \u00fea leofestan, hu \u00feas halgan bec eow myngia\u00f0 \u00feone weg \u00e6tywia\u00f0 and eac in gel\u00e6da\u00f0 to\nClypa\u00f0 ure drihten \u00feurh his witegan swi\u00f0e sti\u00f0lice to \u00f0am preostum, \u00fee godes folce wisian scylan, \u00fe\u00e6t\nGif \u00feu \u00feonne nelt \u00feam unrihtwisan his synna cy\u00f0an, \u00feu bist his sawle scyldig.\nHer ge magon gehyran, bro\u00f0ru \u00f0a leofestan, \u00fe\u00e6t ealle godes m\u00e6ssepreostas and biscopas and o\u00f0re\nBe \u00f0am cwe\u00f0 drihten \u00feurh \u00feone witegan: Audiens ex ore meo sermonem meum, adnuntiabis eis ex me,\nNu ge magon ongitan, hwylcne ege \u00fea m\u00e6ssepreostas habba\u00f0 toweardne, \u00feonne god wile girnan to hym\n\u00deonne we witan, \u00fe\u00e6t anra manna gehwylc m\u00e6g earfo\u00f0lice be his agenre sawle gescead agyldan on\nFor\u00feam us is micel \u00feearf, \u00fe\u00e6t we eow \u00feone weg cy\u00f0en and \u00fe\u00e6t si\u00f0f\u00e6t \u00e6tywen, \u00fee ge \u00feurh magon to\nAnd eac eow is to warnienne, for\u00f0an gif hit us is frecenlic, \u00fe\u00e6t we hit eow ne cy\u00f0en, hit is eow micele\n\u00deonne \u00feurh \u00feone witegan is gecweden: Gif \u00feu bytst \u00feam synfullum, \u00fe\u00e6t he of his unrihtan wegum\nEalra \u00e6rest sceal \u00e6lc cristen man witan and on his heortan trumlice healdan \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6reste bebod and \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd o\u00f0er bebod is \u00feysum fulgelic, \u00fe\u00e6t is, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lc man lufige his nextan swa hine sylfne.\nNu wen\u00f0 manig man, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feis sy gecweden be his freondum, \u00fee him gesibbeste synt and \u00feurh\nAc hit nis be \u00f0am gesibban na swi\u00f0or gecweden, \u00feonne be \u00f0am fremdan.\nAc ure \u00e6lc is o\u00f0res nehsta \u00feurh \u00feone rihtan geleafan, \u00fee we to urum drihtne habba\u00f0, and we synd\n\u00dey cwe\u00f0 se h\u00e6lend on his godspelle: Omnia qu\u00e6cumque vultis, ut faciant vobis homi